; ==========================================================================
; Epoch Slice 3 — full Lattice age (V). The 12 remaining Lattice techs
; (Molecular Assembly anchor + Metamaterials shipped Slice 1-2). Real req1/req2
; per doc/design/epoch-tech-tree.md §4/§5. Completes the tree at 115 techs.
;
; root_req strategy (same principle as Slice 2's Genome Cartography fix, now
; for the Lattice anchor): explicit root_req = "Molecular Assembly" on the
; Lattice ENTRY nodes that don't otherwise inherit it —
;   - Adaptive Fabrication (MA + Machine Cognition): MA is req1 but theft
;     ignores req1, and the MA anchor carries no root_req to pass down.
;   - Deep Habitation (Abyssal Engineering + MA) and Living Architecture
;     (Reclamation Science + MA): same — req1 is a Helix tech (carries GC not
;     MA), req2 is the bare anchor.
;   - Neural Uplink (Cybernetic Symbiosis + Synthetic Cognition): the pure
;     orphan — BOTH prereqs are Helix, neither touches the Lattice anchor, so
;     without this it would be an age-V tech reachable with only age-IV techs.
; Everything else (Plasma Containment, Skyhook Tethers, Fusion Lattices,
; Orbital Foundries/Ordnance, Autonomous Legions, Planetary Stewardship,
; Ascendant Intelligence) inherits MA through one of those + inherits GC
; through its Helix ancestry, so age V requires BOTH anchors by construction.
; ==========================================================================

